OL,12,     FDigging for Gold: The team arrives
OL,13,     Fat Dawson City and sets up a
OL,14,     Fmining camp in the gold fields -
OL,15,     Fbut they have just five days to
OL,16,     Ffind gold using only traditional
OL,17,     F19th-century methods.
